     "status": "carried_out",
     "excerpt": "I’ve tightened S2 so 5% is an actual maximum, with only specific regulator-authorized conditional sales after review and required corrective action/retesting. This accounts for the shared Hearth 10 result without treating the benchmark as optional. I remain supportive of S5’s prompt notification, documented assessment, and regulator-directed corrective action rather than an automatic rate-only recall.",
     "comparison": "S2 permits above-5% conditional sales (weakened vs acceptable max 5%); S5 makes >8/100k a notification/assessment trigger rather than mandatory recall (weakened vs acceptable recall trigger 8 or bounded corrective action)."
